OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by falling tree as
OL,4,AStorm Boelo brings strong winds and
OL,5,Aheavy rain to UK
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has died after being hit by a
OL,8,Ftree, as Storm Boelo brings flooding,
OL,9,Ftravel disruption, and power cuts to
OL,10,Fthe UK
OL,12,FThe 60-year-old was hit at 10:30 near
OL,13,FCastle Douglas in Dumfries and Galloway
OL,14,F- police say there are no suspicious
OL,15,Fcircumstances
OL,17,FMore than 80,000 customers across Great
OL,18,FBritain were without power this
OL,19,Fmorning, and there were also power cuts
OL,20,Facross the island of Ireland
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
