OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by falling tree as
OL,4,AStorm Boelo brings strong winds and
OL,5,Aheavy rain to UK
OL,6,
OL,7,FAmber warnings for wind remain in place
OL,8,Facross large parts of Scotland and
OL,9,Fnorthern England - one grandmother in
OL,10,FLancashire tells us how a tree fell on
OL,11,Fher car as she watched Strictly
